# Project Brief

## Overview
Develop a secure and scalable web application that enables users to submit and validate tax returns with third-party API integrations such as DATEV and Agenta. The app will offer two service tiers:
1. Basic Package: Users submit tax forms and documents for manual submission.
2. Premium Package: Includes tax advisor review to optimize tax returns..

## Core Requirements
1. User Authentication & Role Management: Clients, Tax Agents, and Admins with role-based access.
2. Tax Return Submission: Forms and document uploads.
3. Tax Advisor Review: Review, validation, and recommendations.
4. Third-Party API Integration: Validate tax data with DATEV and Agenta.
5. Security & Compliance: GDPR compliance, AES-256 encryption, multi-factor authentication.
6. Elegant UI/UX: Modern, user-friendly, mobile-responsive design.
7. Scalability: Cloud-based infrastructure using Docker and Kubernetes.

## Project Goals
1. Ensure secure data handling for sensitive financial documents.
2. Provide a seamless and intuitive user experience.
3. Optimize tax return accuracy and maximize benefits for users.
4. Maintain high availability and performance for heavy data loads.

## Scope & Constraints
1. The application will initially target users in Germany.
2. Compliance with German financial regulations.
3. High security due to sensitive financial data.
4. Scalable to accommodate future expansion.

## Expected Deliverables
1. Full-stack web application (React + NestJS + PostgreSQL)
2. API endpoints for tax return submission and validation
3. Secure authentication and user role management
4. Modern, accessible UI design, maintain the same UI components all over the application.
5. Documentation for deployment, testing, and maintenance

